To build Caddy with the caddy-security (aka authcrunch) plugin
Obtained by adding the plugin to cmd/caddy/main.go
followed by "go get github.com/greenpau/caddy-security@v1.1.31"
Author: Maxime Van den Bossche (KU Leuven)
